    "detailed_description": "Detective work is never easy. When the body of Alexander Wolff is found floating down in the pool at a party for the film about his life, there's only one man (well, Fox) for the job. You were cleared for that whole thing with the gingerbread man, anyway.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/cf4df08298267a2b55b55c2a91a5d7a8.avif?t=1743188069\" /></div><br><br>You\u2019re going to need an edge and that cool tie isn\u2019t enough.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.poster.avif?t=1743188069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.webm?t=1743188069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.mp4?t=1743188069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Thank God they partnered you with Maxwell. His manners are questionable, but he can see all of space and time so it\u2019s easy to forgive the little things.<br><br>With the right information and some light encouragement, Max will take you back to the exact moment you\u2019re looking for.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/5333bdb1576aca1b53eba7e1e6371191.avif?t=1743188069\" /></div><br><br>You can\u2019t just walk into a mob boss\u2019 house. But the murder got you some breathing room and the Chief has made a deal. You've got one night to investigate the house.<br><br>It\u2019s a gorgeous mansion. Eighteen rooms. A three-storey fish tank. A garage larger than your entire apartment and a pool overlooking the coast. <br><br>And they say crime doesn\u2019t pay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/4bc3de6a9624fee0c5d49afee7b97865.avif?t=1743188069\" /></div><br><br>9 suspects, one evening. What did they do? What secrets are they hiding?<br><br>They\u2019re not just gonna tell you, that\u2019s for sure.<br><br>Interrogate, cross reference, or just wildly accuse them with no proof. You\u2019re the detective, after all.",
    "about_the_game": "Detective work is never easy. When the body of Alexander Wolff is found floating down in the pool at a party for the film about his life, there's only one man (well, Fox) for the job. You were cleared for that whole thing with the gingerbread man, anyway.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/cf4df08298267a2b55b55c2a91a5d7a8.avif?t=1743188069\" /></div><br><br>You\u2019re going to need an edge and that cool tie isn\u2019t enough.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.poster.avif?t=1743188069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.webm?t=1743188069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.mp4?t=1743188069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Thank God they partnered you with Maxwell. His manners are questionable, but he can see all of space and time so it\u2019s easy to forgive the little things.<br><br>With the right information and some light encouragement, Max will take you back to the exact moment you\u2019re looking for.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/5333bdb1576aca1b53eba7e1e6371191.avif?t=1743188069\" /></div><br><br>You can\u2019t just walk into a mob boss\u2019 house. But the murder got you some breathing room and the Chief has made a deal. You've got one night to investigate the house.<br><br>It\u2019s a gorgeous mansion. Eighteen rooms. A three-storey fish tank. A garage larger than your entire apartment and a pool overlooking the coast. <br><br>And they say crime doesn\u2019t pay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/4bc3de6a9624fee0c5d49afee7b97865.avif?t=1743188069\" /></div><br><br>9 suspects, one evening. What did they do? What secrets are they hiding?<br><br>They\u2019re not just gonna tell you, that\u2019s for sure.<br><br>Interrogate, cross reference, or just wildly accuse them with no proof. You\u2019re the detective, after all.",
    "short_description": "The Wolf is Dead is a murder mystery game. When the Big Bad Wolf is found murdered at a party for his biopic, you're called in. Interrogate suspects, investigate the scene of the crime and use this to travel back in time and reconstruct the events of the evening. Who killed Alexander Wolff?",
